	<item>
		<title>Half Carcass of Bello Beef</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/half-carcass-of-bello-beef/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/half-carcass-of-bello-beef/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 22:07:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=16934</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Based on $23/kg and includes additional shipping costs to ship to most addresses in Australia! The list below includes all your favourite cuts of Bello Beef - organic, grass-fed and grass-finished cattle, grown slow and happy, prioritising the health of the ecosystem of which we all play a role.  Our cattle aren’t drenched (with chemicals), jabbed (with vaccines) or pilled (with growth hormones).  Just nutrient dense, full of flavour beef, grown regeneratively, ethically and sustainably.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you want to customise your half carcass - we can do that too! We offer lots of options, more bones, less offal, french trim or giant thors.  Our butcher can work with you to get the cuts, portions and packs to suit your beefy needs.</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">3 x 800g Osso Bucco</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">3 x 1.5kg Topside Roast</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">3 x 500g Strips</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">3 x 600g Rump</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">3 x 500g Rump</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">4 x 250g Eye Fillet</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">15 x 500g Diced Beef</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">5 x 500g T-Bone</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">5 x 600g Porterhouse</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">5 x 450g Scotch Fillet</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">6 x 520g Blade</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">6 x 540g Y-Bone</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">18 x 500g Mince</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">6 x 500g Beef Patties</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">9 x 400g Minces with offal</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">38 x 450g Bello Beef Sausages</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">10 x 2kg Bones Chuck</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">2 x 1kg Meaty Bones</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">1 x 1kg Soft Spongy Bones</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">4 x 500g Marrow Trimmed Bones</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">2 x 5kg Fat</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">2 x 1kg Liver</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">1 x 1kg Tongue</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">1 x 1kg Tail</span></li>
</ul>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/half-carcass-of-bello-beef/">Half Carcass of Bello Beef</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/half-carcass-of-bello-beef/">Half Carcass of Bello Beef</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
