			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Ultimate BBQ Bello Beef Box</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/ultimate-bbq-bello-beef-box/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/ultimate-bbq-bello-beef-box/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 22:03:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=16932</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Nothing much better than a BBQ, any night of the week. The “Ultimate BBQ” Pack is enough for a party, or several easy family dinners.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our ”Ultimate BBQ” box includes:</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">5 x 450g packs organic Bello Beef sausages (5)</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">2 x 500g packs organic Bello Beef burger patties (4)</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">2 x 500g organic Flat Iron steaks</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">That’s 25 sausages, 8 patties + 4 BBQ steaks made from our organic, 100% grass-fed beef!</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">EVERYTHING is gluten and grain free!</span></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/ultimate-bbq-bello-beef-box/">Ultimate BBQ Bello Beef Box</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/ultimate-bbq-bello-beef-box/">Ultimate BBQ Bello Beef Box</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
