				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=16930</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This box is for the lover of the bone.  Whether it’s the slow cooked goodness of osso bucco or chewing on a T-Bone or Short Rib - this 5kg box will have you savouring the taste of our organic, grass-fed beef bone cuts.</span></p>
<p><strong>You will receive:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">2 x 800g packs Osso</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">2 x 500g T-Bone</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">3 x 500g Y Bone</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">1 x 1kg Short Rib Roast</span></li>
</ul>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/beef-on-the-bone-bello-beef-box/">Beef on the Bone Bello Beef Box</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
