		<item>
		<title>The BIG Sausage Bello Beef Box</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/the-big-sausage-bello-beef-box/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/the-big-sausage-bello-beef-box/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 21:52:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=16929</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you LOVE Bello Beef sausages then THIS is the box for you.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Includes 20 packets of our Bello Beef Sausages.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">ALL of our sausages are hand-made with love, gluten free, and contain only organic beef, natural hog casings, sea salt and the fresh herbs, spices and vegetables that give them their delicious flavour.</span></p>
<p><em><strong>You’ll get a mix of our 5 flavours</strong></em></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Argentine: Coriander &#38; Garlic</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Thai: Ginger &#38; Lemongrass</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Paleo/Aussie: Beetroot &#38; Honey</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">English: Roasted Apple with Sage</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Italian: Capsicum, Paprika &#38; Fennel Seeds</span></li>
</ul>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/the-big-sausage-bello-beef-box/">The BIG Sausage Bello Beef Box</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
