		<item>
		<title>The Basics Bello Beef Box</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/the-basics-bello-beef-box/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/the-basics-bello-beef-box/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 21:31:05 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=16916</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Bricks and mortar, the BASICS Bello Beef Box includes approximately 5kg of all the cuts we know and love.  Growing up in my house in the 80’s &#38; 90’s meant Roast Beef, Shepherd’s Pie, Stir-Fry, Curry &#38; a BBQ steak.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Bello Beef is 100% grass-fed and finished on our certified organic farm - here’s what you get in the 5kg Basics Box:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">3 x 500g organic beef mince</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">2 x 500g organic diced beef</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">1 x 500g organic beef strips</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">1 x 1.5kg organic topside roast</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">1 x 500g organic rump</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Nutritious &#38; delicious meals, a perfect box for feeding a family a variety of easy, healthy dinners.</span></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/the-basics-bello-beef-box/">The Basics Bello Beef Box</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/the-basics-bello-beef-box/">The Basics Bello Beef Box</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
